    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        176.67379003267973,
        523.2867660984848,
        146.13826960784314,
        15.514733901515172
      ],
      "text": "Resource exit",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        557.1350486111112,
        685.7962977941177,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "If you want to prevent ACIF from collecting a specific type of resource, such as overlays, you ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        572.6651186868687,
        133.54604411764703,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "can use the ACIF ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        362.5686441993464,
        572.8584450757576,
        58.584980392156865,
        11.420700126262602
      ],
      "text": "restype",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/BookMasterGothic-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        425.77696078431376,
        572.6653516414142,
        467.4973080065359,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "parameter. However, if you want to prevent ACIF from writing a ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.116910130719,
        588.1954217171717,
        436.5597933006535,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "specific resource to the resource file, use the resource exit.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.116910130719,
        616.6929583333333,
        673.1967030228758,
        11.923364267676732
      ],
      "text": "The resource exit is best used to control resources at the file name level. For example, you ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.116910130719,
        632.2230154671718,
        652.1114983660129,
        11.92337720959597
      ],
      "text": "want to exclude particular fonts from the resource file. You can code this exit program to ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.116910130719,
        647.7530855429293,
        687.4358790849674,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "contain a table of the fonts that you want to exclude and filter them from the resource file. The ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.116910130719,
        663.2831556186868,
        420.98280800653595,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "program that is invoked at this exit is defined in the ACIF ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        649.9696000816994,
        663.4764820075758,
        58.58498039215681,
        11.420713068181783
      ],
      "text": "resexit",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/BookMasterGothic-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        713.1789383169935,
        663.2845404040404,
        79.97384967320261,
        11.923364267676675
      ],
      "text": "parameter.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11716135620915,
        691.782077020202,
        442.0846940359477,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "ACIF does not start the exit for the following resource types:",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11716135620915,
        713.9505621843434,
        8.340686274509807,
        11.356210542929318
      ],
      "text": "GLYPH<SM590000>",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/BookMaster",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.2350763888889,
        713.7572099116162,
        663.4616482843137,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "Page definitions: The pagedef is a required resource for converting line data to AFP and it ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.2350763888889,
        729.2872541035354,
        270.51185334967323,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "is never included in the resource file.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11716135620915,
        751.5330801767677,
        8.340686274509807,
        11.356210542929318
      ],
      "text": "GLYPH<SM590000>",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/BookMaster",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        253.2350763888889,
        751.3397279040405,
        663.4435600490197,
        11.92339015151515
      ],
      "text": "Form definitions: The formdef is a required resource for processing print files. If you do not ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
